    "translation": "Ffurfweddu gosodiadau rhwydwaith"
  },
  "Configure networking for this TrueNAS system.\n\n  • Interface settings  – DHCP, IP aliases, MTU\n  • Network settings    – Hostname, domain, gateways, DNS\n  • Static routes       – Add and remove static routes\n\nChanges to interfaces require a commit step\nbefore they take effect.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Ffurfweddu rhwydweithio ar gyfer y system TrueNAS hon.\n\n  • Gosodiadau rhyngwyneb – DHCP, arallenwau IP, MTU\n  • Gosodiadau rhwydwaith – Enw gwesteiwr, parth, pyrth, DNS\n  • Llwybrau sefydlog – Ychwanegu a dileu llwybrau sefydlog\n\nMae angen cam ymrwymo i newid rhyngwynebau\ncyn iddynt ddod i rym."
